   Pacific Lowlands of Guerrero, Mexico},
Journal = {JOURNAL OF HERPETOLOGY},
Year = {2018},
Volume = {52},
Number = {3},
Pages = {327-331},
Month = {SEP},
Abstract = {We describe a new species of the genus Lepidophyma from the Pacific
   lowlands of Guerrero, southern Mexico. Previously referred to as L.
   smithii, the new taxon is distinguished by a series of morphological
   characteristics, principally higher numbers of gulars, paravertebrals,
   and lateral tubercle rows. This new species increases the number of
   described Lepidophyma to 20 species.},
