Abstract = {Honduranura gen. n. and the type species H. centraliamericana sp. n. are
   described and illustrated. The new genus shows the characters of
   Sensillanurini Cassagnau, 1983 tribe and is distinguished by the fusion
   of cephalic and abdominal tubercles: clypeal with antennofrontal and
   dorsointernal with dorsoexternal on head; presence of fused tubercles on
   each side of abdominal segment V. Most of the tubercles bear strong
   subcuticular reticulation. A key for the genera of the tribe
   Sensillanurini is provided.},
